  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Dune Vista - <br><br>Fall in love with this spectacular 5 bedroom 4.5 bath private beach home. With Over 5,600 square feet of luxurious design and finishings, this home is sure to please! Nestled on the outskirts of Destin (Dune Allen Beach) This high end rental is close to countless locations for shopping and dining. You are within walking distance to Stinky’s Fish Camp which offers some of the best Seafood South Walton has to offer. Dune Allen Beach is wonderful because you have the seclusion of being on Scenic Hwy. 30A, but you’re only a few miles from Sandestin. Here you will find a Publix supermarket, Silver Sands outlets, and the Village Of Baytowne Wharf. <br><br>Often referred to as “the town that began it all”, Santa Rosa Beach is the first established community in South Walton. Today, many of the communities that make up this majestic collection of beachfront developments are technically in Santa Rosa Beach. The most notable is Gulf Place home to restaurants, bars, shops and galleries. Other attractions include Eden State Garden Park and the Santa Rosa Beach Golf Club. Guests seeking to spend their vacation in Santa Rosa Beach can opt for studio style condos at Gulf Place, large vacation homes with private pools near the beach or beachfront custom homes or townhomes. <br><br>First Floor: Living Room with Queen Sleeper Sofa, Kitchenette, Bedroom with Four Twin Bunks.<br><br>Second Floor: King Master Bedroom, King Bedroom, Queen Bedroom.<br><br>Third Floor: King Master Bedroom, Living Area, Dining, Kitchen.<br><br>*Add $50.00 per day to heat pool (available October - April if needed).<br><br>*Rates reflect a discount for nearby construction. <br><br>*Note – This property may have date restrictions that apply. All reservations submitted online are a request until receiving an email confirmation from Ocean Reef Resorts. For more details, please review our Minimum Night Stay under Rental Policies. An e-signed rental agreement is required prior to arrival.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Dune Vista - Dune Allen Beach! 30A! Gulf Views! Private Pool! Steps to the Sand!"
        }
      ],
